RISK CALCULATION   (design/formula.md)
  driving path   contest → web + nameservers
  p              0.30   exact-prefix origin contest, always possible without ASPA (assumed share)
  P per attempt  0.025   = p × P(≥ 3 of 4 remote perspectives fooled)   [BR 3.2.2.9]
  likelihood L   0.119   = 1 − (1 − P)^5
  complexity K   0.870   = 0.87^1   (wins only where the attacker's route is preferred)
  score          1.1   = Roundup(10 × 1 × K × L)   → Low (CVSS scale)

